他们在悉尼和墨尔本之间无法抉择。

236
00:10:06.230 --> 00:10:07.990
And it was a really heated debate.
那是一场非常激烈的争论。

237
00:10:08.050 --> 00:10:09.230
And they couldn't agree.
他们无法达成一致。

238
00:10:09.230 --> 00:10:13.650
So, they literally built a whole new city in the middle of both of those cities.
所以，他们干脆在那两座城市中间新建了一座城市。

239
00:10:13.910 --> 00:10:15.190
Just to make it the capital?
就为了把它定为首都？

240
00:10:15.350 --> 00:10:15.650
Yes.
是的。

241
00:10:15.910 --> 00:10:16.790
Isn't that amazing?
这难道不神奇吗？

242
00:10:16.970 --> 00:10:17.290
Yeah.
确实。

243
00:10:17.290 --> 00:10:22.510
Well, Kimmy G got me curious about Canberra, and I started looking up details about the city.
基米·G让我对堪培拉产生了好奇，我开始查找关于这座城市的细节。

244
00:10:22.650 --> 00:10:23.710
It looks very cool.
它看起来非常酷。

245
00:10:23.750 --> 00:10:30.810
But the thing that really stood out to me is that there are all of these rumors, I guess,
但真正让我印象深刻的是，有各种传言，我想，

246
00:10:30.970 --> 00:10:37.450
or stories, scuttlebutt, lore, lore, Canberra lore, maybe urban legends,
或者故事、流言、传说、堪培拉传说，也许是都市传说，

247
00:10:38.390 --> 00:10:43.750
that there are these secret underground tunnels throughout the whole city.
说整个城市地下都有秘密隧道。

248
00:10:43.750 --> 00:10:50.950
And I guess the rumors are that these tunnels have been used for, like, international espionage.
我猜传闻说这些隧道被用于国际间谍活动之类的。

249
00:10:50.970 --> 00:10:52.530
Oh, super sleuthing?
噢，超级侦探行动？

250
00:10:52.730 --> 00:10:53.050
Yes.
是的。

251
00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:54.450
Sleuthing in Canberra?
在堪培拉搞侦探调查？

252
00:10:54.750 --> 00:11:00.030
So, I digged some more, and I think most of the rumors have been debunked.
所以我又深挖了一下，我觉得大部分传言都已经被辟谣了。

253
00:11:00.310 --> 00:11:00.690
Hmm.
嗯。

254
00:11:01.070 --> 00:11:07.730
But then I started to think that the debunking was part of a conspiracy to hide the tunnels.
但后来我开始觉得，辟谣本身就是掩盖地道阴谋的一部分。

255
00:11:07.870 --> 00:11:10.750
Like, I went so deep on the tunnels.
就像，我在地道这件事上钻研得太深了。

256
00:11:11.070 --> 00:11:12.450
Here's what I've decided.
我决定好了。

257
00:11:12.710 --> 00:11:13.050
Okay.
好啊。

258
00:11:13.050 --> 00:11:17.690
Lady, when Mom Detectives is in its, like, fifth season.
Lady，等《妈妈侦探》拍到第五季的时候。

259
00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:18.910
We're going to Australia?
我们要去澳大利亚吗？

260
00:11:19.090 --> 00:11:19.370
Yes.
对。

261
00:11:19.410 --> 00:11:21.730
We need, like, an international episode.
我们需要一集国际篇。

262
00:11:22.750 --> 00:11:25.230
We investigate the tunnels of Canberra.
我们要去调查堪培拉的地道。

263
00:11:25.410 --> 00:11:26.350
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

264
00:11:26.450 --> 00:11:26.850
Yes.
没错。

265
00:11:27.230 --> 00:11:33.510
Well, Lady, I knew that Canberra was the nation's capital because one of my best friends ever,
Lady，我知道堪培拉是澳大利亚的首都，因为我最好的朋友之一，

266
00:11:33.830 --> 00:11:35.350
Micah, is from Canberra.
Micah，就是堪培拉人。

267
00:11:35.790 --> 00:11:36.910
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

268
00:11:37.130 --> 00:11:37.450
Yes.
对。

269
00:11:37.450 --> 00:11:38.350
I didn't know that.
我之前不知道。

270
00:11:38.510 --> 00:11:39.530
Does he know about the tunnels?
他知道地道的事吗？

271
00:11:39.870 --> 00:11:40.350
I don't know.
我不知道。

272
00:11:40.430 --> 00:11:41.110
We can call him.
我们可以给他打电话。

273
00:11:41.230 --> 00:11:41.810
Should we call him?
我们要打给他吗？

274
00:11:41.810 --> 00:11:42.270
Yes.
好。

275
00:11:42.490 --> 00:11:42.790
Yes.
好。

276
00:11:42.790 --> 00:11:44.710
We can get to the bottom of it right now.
我们现在就能把这件事查个水落石出。

277
00:11:44.870 --> 00:11:48.210
We're going to call my friend, Michael Peters, also known as Micah.
我们要给我的朋友Michael Peters打电话，也就是Micah。

278
00:11:48.610 --> 00:11:49.170
Let's see.
我看看。

279
00:11:49.290 --> 00:11:50.070
Let's give him a buzz.
给他打个电话吧。

280
00:11:55.560 --> 00:11:56.220
Hey, Micah.
嘿，Micah。

281
00:11:56.380 --> 00:11:57.640
We're calling you from the podcaSt.
我们正在播客节目里给你打电话。

282
00:11:57.940 --> 00:11:58.600
It's Angela and Jenna.
我是Angela和Jenna。

283
00:11:58.880 --> 00:11:59.260
Hi.
嗨。

284
00:11:59.980 --> 00:12:00.400
Hi.
嗨。

285
00:12:00.540 --> 00:12:01.020
How are you?
你好吗？

286
00:12:01.020 --> 00:12:05.620
We have a random question for you about Canberra, your hometown.
我们有个关于你家乡堪培拉的问题想问你。

287
00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:06.800
Yes.
好。

288
00:12:06.820 --> 00:12:07.100
Okay.
行。

289
00:12:07.420 --> 00:12:09.240
Here is what I need to know.
我想知道这个。

290
00:12:09.600 --> 00:12:18.340
Is it true that there's an elaborate tunnel system underneath the city that is used for espionage?
传闻说城市下面有一个用于间谍活动的复杂地道系统，这是真的吗？

291
00:12:19.280 --> 00:12:19.920
Oh, God.
天哪。

292
00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:20.700
Have you heard this rumor?
你听说过这个传言吗？

293
00:12:20.700 --> 00:12:23.000
That I do not know.
这个我不知道。

294
00:12:23.400 --> 00:12:27.420
I heard that there were tunnels underneath the Parliament House.
我听说议会大厦下面确实有地道。

295
00:12:28.520 --> 00:12:32.280
Because, you know, the whole government sits in Canberra.
因为，你知道，整个政府都在堪培拉办公。

296
00:12:32.920 --> 00:12:33.220
Yes.
对。

297
00:12:33.220 --> 00:12:36.300
I don't know about secret spy tunnels.
但我不知道有什么秘密间谍地道。

298
00:12:36.920 --> 00:12:42.740
So, I was able to confirm that there are little tunnels under the Parliament House.
所以我确认了议会大厦下面确实有一些小地道。

299
00:12:42.920 --> 00:12:49.340
But I read this rumor that their secret passageways go all the way under Lake Burley Griffin.
但我读到的传言说，那些秘密通道一直延伸到了伯利格里芬湖下面。

300
00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:51.180
Wow.
哇。

301
00:12:51.440 --> 00:12:52.340
That's very cool.
那太酷了。

302
00:12:52.540 --> 00:12:53.720
I did not know that, though.
不过我之前确实不知道。

303
00:12:54.180 --> 00:12:57.700
You want to tell them what you told me last night, what Canberra is known for?
你想告诉他们你昨晚跟我说的，堪培拉以什么闻名吗？

304
00:12:58.060 --> 00:12:59.360
Two things you said.
你说了两件事。

305
00:12:59.360 --> 00:13:02.640
Well, Canberra is, you know, the capital of Australia.
嗯，堪培拉是澳大利亚的首都。

306
00:13:02.820 --> 00:13:04.180
It's like Australia's D.C.
就像澳大利亚的华盛顿特区一样。

307
00:13:04.660 --> 00:13:10.160
And it's also famous because it's where they make all the porn in Australia.
而且它之所以出名，是因为澳大利亚所有的色情片都是在那里制作的。

308
00:13:12.540 --> 00:13:14.520
It's the Van Nuys of Australia.
它就是澳大利亚的范奈斯。

309
00:13:16.960 --> 00:13:24.460
And I'm pretty sure we're also the only state, because it's a territory like D.C., the Australian capital territory, where you're allowed to have fireworks.
而且我很确定我们也是唯一一个州——因为它像华盛顿特区一样是个领地，即澳大利亚首都领地——允许燃放烟花的地方。

310
00:13:25.160 --> 00:13:25.640
Oh.
噢。

311
00:13:26.460 --> 00:13:27.080
How about that?
怎么样？

312
00:13:27.640 --> 00:13:28.800
Fireworks and porn.
烟花和色情片。

313
00:13:28.800 --> 00:13:29.800
How about that?
怎么样？

314
00:13:29.800 --> 00:13:29.980
Yeah.
没错。

315
00:13:30.400 --> 00:13:31.200
And tunnels.
还有隧道。

316
00:13:31.920 --> 00:13:33.620
And, like, legal prostitution, too.
还有合法的卖淫活动。

317
00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:34.280
Oh.
噢。

318
00:13:34.700 --> 00:13:36.740
Well, Canberra, stepping it up.
看来堪培拉确实在不断升级啊。

319
00:13:36.860 --> 00:13:37.720
What about gambling?
那赌博呢？

320
00:13:38.020 --> 00:13:39.160
Can I gamble there?
我能在那里赌博吗？

321
00:13:39.700 --> 00:13:40.880
Yeah, there's a casino.
可以，那里有赌场。

322
00:13:41.220 --> 00:13:41.440
Yep.
没错。

